  m_text: "<b><size=36><color=#00008B>Key Features</color></size></b>\n\r\n\u2022
    Interactive 3D tilapia anatomy models across three modes: External, Skeletal,
    and Internal\r\n\u2022 Real-time manipulation of 3D models (rotate and zoom)\r\n\u2022
    Tap-to-reveal body part information with voice narration\r\n\u2022 Marker-based
    AR accessible on mobile devices\r\n\u2022 Curriculum-ready for fisheries and
    marine science classroom use"
