  m_text: '     <b><color=#00008B>TILA</color></b> is a mobile Augmented Reality
    learning tool designed for classroom use in fisheries and marine science education.
    It transforms static tilapia anatomy content into interactive 3D experiences.
    Using AR, students can explore external, skeletal, and internal anatomy in real
    time.'
